course: dictionary
lesson: 8000
title: Words about people
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A redhead is a noun, a word for a person. It means someone with red or orange-red hair. The plural is «redheads». Look at the word's parts: red and head. The parts help you guess the meaning.
explain: The dictionary has a second meaning too: some birds and animals have red heads, like the redhead duck in North America. Use the context to pick the right meaning. «The redhead duck swam across the lake» is about a bird, not a person.
explain: Context also tells you about feelings. «A fiery redhead» is a stereotype, a story people wrongly tell that redheads are always angry or wild. Calling someone «ginger» in a mean way can be bullying, so choose your words kindly.
explain: Some texts give hair facts. «A head has about 100,000 hairs; blondes often have more and redheads fewer, and losing about 50 to 100 hairs a day is normal.» The context tells you that redheads usually have fewer hairs, and that losing some each day is normal.
fact: A redhead is a noun: a person with red or orange-red hair.
fact: «Redheads» is the plural, for more than one person.
fact: Some birds and animals are called redheads too, such as the redhead duck in North America.
fact: Red hair comes from genes passed down from parents.
fact: Calling someone «ginger» in a mean way is bullying.
exercise: «The redhead duck swam across the lake.» What is a redhead here? | A kind of hat | *A bird with a red head | A red-haired teacher | A person with red hair
exercise: What is the plural of redhead, when you mean more than one person? | redheadings | *redheads | redheadies | redhead's
exercise: What does «a fiery redhead» suggest as a stereotype? | A type of duck | *A story people wrongly tell, that redheads are always angry or wild | A kind of red hair dye | A proven fact about every redhead
test: In «A head has about 100,000 hairs; blondes often have more and redheads fewer», which group has fewer hairs? | 100,000 | a head | blondes | *redheads
test: Is it kind to call a classmate «ginger» in a mean way? | Yes, it is a friendly nickname for everyone | Yes, if they laugh about it | *No, it can be bullying, so choose kind words
exam: Which is the best meaning of «a natural redhead»? | Someone who dyes their hair red | A bird with a red head | *Someone born with red hair | A fiery, angry person
